[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今夜はベップちゃんの儀式の日だったわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tonight's the ceremony for little Bepp, isn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっかぁ～、もうそんな時期かあ。\nベップのお仕事は何になるかな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh yeah, it's that time already, huh? I wonder what your calling will be, Bepp."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "できれば、姉様を助けられるものだと嬉しい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'd be happy if it was something that helps you, my dear sister."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップの剣の腕はすごいからなあ。ヤンネさんみたいに\n聖戦士に選ばれちゃったりするんじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, you're amazing with a sword. Maybe you'll be chosen as a Sacred Knight like Janne!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうなったら嬉しいわね。近頃、引退者も増えていて、\n人手が足りてないのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That would be wonderful. We've had quite a few retirements lately, so we're rather short-handed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "集会が始まるぞ。私語は慎め",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The assembly is beginning. No more chatter."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（いよいよ、アタシも成人を迎えた――\n\u3000今日、ここでアタシの未来が決まる）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(At last, I've come of age—\nToday, my future will be decided.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アタシも、みんなに憧れられるような英雄に……！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I want to become a hero that everyone can look up to...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむ、なるほど。アルビーナ・ジムロックよ。\n星の神より授かりし天命を告げます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, I see. Alvina Zimlock.\nI shall now relay the divine calling bestowed by the Star God."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップ・ジムロック。あなたの天命は――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp Zimlock. Your divine calling is—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――聖戦士です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Sacred Knight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――――！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "——!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずは見習いからになりますが、この国と民たちを\n守るため、その腕を振るいなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You'll start as an apprentice, but wield your blade\nto protect this nation and its people."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……承知しました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I understand."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ベップが、本当に聖戦士に……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Bepp really became a Sacred Knight...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆も知っての通り、ここひと月ほど、\n街の井戸が涸れ、水の確保が困難になっています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As you all know, for the past month, the town's wells have run dry, making water procurement difficult."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "北の森にある水源から水を運び難を凌いでいますが、\n運び手たちが魔物に襲われる事例も起こっています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've been managing by transporting water from the northern forest's spring, but our carriers have been attacked by monsters."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その護衛も聖戦士の務めの１つ。\nこの苦境の中、あなたの働きに期待します",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Protecting them is one of a Sacred Knight's duties.\nWe expect much from you in these trying times."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この水不足は我々に与えられた試練です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This water shortage is a trial given to us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし、星への感謝を忘れず、清らかな心で祈りを\n捧げれば、星の神は必ず導いてくださるはずです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if we maintain our gratitude to the stars and offer our prayers\nwith pure hearts, the Star God will surely guide us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "星の神よ。我らを導き給え",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "O Star God, guide us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民たち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizens"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（水不足かあ……原因は分からないけれど、\n\u3000本当不便な話だよね……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Water shortage, huh... We don't know the cause,\nbut it's really becoming inconvenient...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アタシの錬金術で、何か力になれたりしないかな）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I wonder if there's anything I could do to help with my alchemy.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へっ？\u3000あ、ああベップ。おかえり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Oh, welcome back, Bepp."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにしても、ベップが本当に聖戦士かあ～！\n自慢の妹よの～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To think you really became a Sacred Knight!\nI'm so proud of my little sister!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どしたい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "以前、ヤンネさんから聞いたわ。\n姉様は、聖戦士になりたがっていたと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard from Janne before.\nThat you wanted to become a Sacred Knight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あぁ、昔の話だよ。ただの子どもの頃の夢だってぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Ah, that's ancient history. Just a childhood dream, that's all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おめでとうベップ。頑張ってね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Congratulations, Bepp. Do your best."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はい。ありがとう、姉様",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yes. Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――１年と少し前",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—A Little Over a Year Ago"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "字幕",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caption"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]